{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/dt2qD5feZoNJTB_XVHWX6Q","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:05.717841+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/dt2qD5feZoNJTB_XVHWX6Q","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/7Cb6d9Osf9vWR2sW2QjOgaYbRctjG6kNcKFAjzr3v5icCKJarqHvx7jMDgIKpuqoIze44ZKHA9F3Yvd6ibzT2ibZw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>上海市重大传染病和生物安全研究院将依托复旦大学公共卫生学院举办全国优秀大学生夏令营活动，欢迎全国各院校的优秀大学生报名参加。具体安排如下（同时</span><span><strong><span>点击最下方阅读原文</span></strong></span><span>可见复旦大学公共卫生学院通知）。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>01</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>2025年夏令营活动简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>上海市重大传染病和生物安全研究院（网址：https://siidb.fudan.edu.cn，以下简称“市传研院”）是由上海市人民政府与复旦大学共建的科研机构，是复旦大学校内二级实体科研机构。市传研院依托复旦大学，在传染病领域进行创新的基础与应用科学研究，目标是为应对全球重大传染病提供科技支撑。市传研院拥有世界顶尖的科研设施设备、良好的工作环境和优秀的服务支撑团队。研究生导师来自公共卫生、基础医学、临床医学和生物医学等多学科，承担着培养学科交叉人才的任务。市传研院将面向全国优秀应届本科毕业生招收推荐免试研究生，包括重大传染病和生物安全的流行病学、重大传染病和生物安全的相关生物学和基础医学、重大传染病和生物安全的相关临床医学、重大传染病和生物安全的应急和社会治理、生物安全、疫苗研发与评价、感染与老龄化、卫生政策、卫生应急管理、城市公共卫生治理、卫生社会组织管理、公共卫生政府运作保障管理等十余个研究生招生方向。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>上海市重大传染病和生物安全研究院</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/7Cb6d9Osf9vWR2sW2QjOgaYbRctjG6kNMKTUPyrL6tZtTSA4TXJHG40avexHlic2iawe3LFwYgqqvu5icJuHPiaLDw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/7Cb6d9Osf9vWR2sW2QjOgaYbRctjG6kNhceWDG0hEaqsXMgSweTibPOs5xmw3LApyMz6kgOoTpNaGB0exx4FTIg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/7Cb6d9Osf9vWR2sW2QjOgaYbRctjG6kNibiavWbicbHtzSpeCeXib4KlhMyaIwX5hFurHibCrLtichs9lP17tjPfE5ow/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/7Cb6d9Osf9vWR2sW2QjOgaYbRctjG6kNLsr7dI9ia2OKHibib7ExFyA19ibbC8wTJ5ib0SUWAjg52tXxtibOVcH1X2ibA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/7Cb6d9Osf9vWR2sW2QjOgaYbRctjG6kNia99HVEEpqwP50zkvkv8R0d3m55ibZQB4JVPgFic6lYLia378knviaR5GZQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>左右滑动查看更多</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>为促进我国高校优秀大学生之间的思想交流，增进对市传研院研究生教育的深入了解，激发同学们对重大传染病和生物安全领域研究的兴趣，鼓励将来申请市传研院推荐免试研究生，我院精心策划了本次夏令营活动，欢迎公共卫生、基础医学、临床医学、生物安全、公共管理和大数据等相关专业背景的学生报名。</span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>02</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>即日起至6月20日17:00</span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>03</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 全国各高等学校2026年应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>2. 学业成绩优秀，预期可获得推荐免试资格。</span></p><p><span>3. 具有较强的学术创新或实践应用能力。</span></p><p><span>4. 英语水平良好。</span></p><p><span>5. 品行良好，无作弊作假或其他违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p><p><span>6. 实事求是，学风严谨，遵守学术道德规范。</span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>04</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 近期正面免冠彩色证件照片，电子版JPG格式，150×200像素，大小500K以内。</span></p><p><span>2. 个人简历及陈述1份。</span></p><p><span>3. 本科阶段成绩单和专业排名证明（均须由教务部门盖章）各1份。</span></p><p><span>4. 外语水平证明，如CET四级、CET六级、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等。</span></p><p><span>5. 有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作。</span></p><p><span>6. 考生诚信考核承诺书。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>申请人应保证填报信息、提交材料的真实性和准确性。凡提供虚假信息的，一经查实即取消申请资格。</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>05</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>登录</span><strong><span>复旦大学研究生招生网</span></strong><span>，通过“</span><strong><span>研究生报考服务系统</span></strong><span>”中的“</span><strong><span>全国优秀大学生夏令营</span></strong><span>”进行网上报名。</span></p><p><span>本院无需考生寄送纸质材料。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>复旦大学研究生招生网：</span></p><p><span><span>https://gsao.fudan.edu.cn</span></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>06</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>相关说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 本次夏令营活动举办时间、方式等，另行通知。</span></p><p><span>2. 营员遴选结果拟于报名结束后7个工作日内通过复旦大学研究生报考服务系统发布。</span></p><p><span>3. 申请人应承诺填报信息和提交材料的真实性。如有弄虚作假，一经发现将取消申请资格并通报其本科院校。</span></p><p><span>4. 如果上级部门和学校关于夏令营活动有新要求，我单位将按新要求执行并及时通知申请人。</span></p><p><span>5. 咨询方式和监督申诉渠道</span></p><p><span><strong><span>复旦大学公共卫生学院</span></strong></span></p><p><span>咨询电话：毛老师 021-54237706</span></p><p><span>邮箱：gssph@fudan.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><strong><span>上海市重大传染病和生物安全研究院</span></strong></span></p><p><span>咨询电话：蒋老师 021-54237345</span></p><p><span>邮箱：siidbst@fudan.edu.cn</span></p><p><strong><span>监督申诉渠道</span></strong><span>：gwkyb@fudan.edu.cn</span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/CSwmPALiaVhP151duRgTEOk7zeEp0khpWfiaibgTTbdte1PJ9at4R8h17W95wgT7bibicJPCLADia0EZAxsxHhJpqUpQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>点击阅读原文查看更多</span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"78750bc3255777c9178d7811512cd7f16ac5a5deb8d0e916de305a03526d9979","textLength":1462,"sourceSha256":"d48b37d63c4adc33ef336d280ea5e219b2984dc57b6895de95a00341870c1ff2","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5874fbfbd6de9a559611","title":"2025年复旦大学上海市重大传染病和生物安全研究院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:05.717841+00:00"}
